Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:27.66,Hook,,0,0,0,,CLIPS POTENTES Y EN 4K
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Lo escuchan, editoras?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:08.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Van a tener potentes los\Nclips, eso seguro, y en\Nfull 4K, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pero apágame todas las\Nluces de arriba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:15.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Para que solo estén estas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No mames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:19.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quién invitó a Rudolph?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No mames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Eh? Pues ni modo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Lo peor es que sí me arde.
